'''Summerluga''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 9.8 Update|Version 9.8]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Gals of Summer Blue Ocean (Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer Blue Ocean]] gacha event. It is a summer variant of [[Nekoluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Nekoluga]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.7 Update|Version 11.7]] increases [[Surge Attack|Surge]] level.

