==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 13.5 Update|Version 13.5]], she could be obtained from the [[Gals of Summer (Removed Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer]] gacha event.
*"Blistering barnacles!" is an expression first used by [[wikipedia:Captain Haddock|Captain Haddock]] in the Belgian comic series ''[[wikipedia:The Adventures of Tintin|The Adventures of Tintin]]''. The full line is "Billions of bilious blue blistering barnacles," which matches up with the alliteration of "Bs" in Bikinilan Pasalan's description.
*Fabulous Pasalan currently has the highest [[Surge Attack|Surge]] level of any Cat.
*Ironically, Summerluga has higher DPS than its Evolved and True Forms when not counting the Surge.
*The bottle in the hands of the true form is seemingly a [[wikipedia:Perrier|Perrier]] bottle.

